Package: libre-workspace-module-silentsuite
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SilentSuite <info@silentsuite.io>
Depends: libre-workspace-portal, bash, coreutils, curl, iproute2, openssl, tar
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://silentsuite.io
Description: SilentSuite sync server add-on for Libre Workspace
 Installs the SilentSuite end-to-end encrypted sync server and its PostgreSQL
 database from a verified, digest-pinned SilentSuite release (@RELEASE@) and
 serves it over HTTPS through the Libre Workspace Caddy. SilentSuite accounts
 are independent of Libre Workspace users; there is no single sign-on.
 Installing this package does not start anything: the server is set up when an
 administrator installs the add-on from the Libre Workspace portal.
